'''26.4''', the release of '''[[Deep Freeze]]''', is an upcoming [[game drop]] for {{JE}} set to release in December 2026, which introduces the [[ice caves]], a new [[cave]] [[biome]] featuring [[icicle]]s, [[ice crystal]]s, and [[brittle ice]], as well as the [[frostbite]]s, [[ice ball]]s, the [[Freezing]] effect, a new block set for [[calcite]], brick variants of [[packed ice bricks|packed ice]] and [[snow bricks|snow block]]s, updated [[jukebox]]es, and fixes bugs.

