** Added {{Tag link|block|triggers_ambient_ice_crystal_sounds}} to describe all blocks that trigger ice crystals to play their ambient sound.
** Added several block tags to affect how mobs pathfind:
*** {{Tag link|block|pathfinding/avoid_in_air}} - blocks to be avoided while flying, either due to danger or potential to get stuck.
*** {{Tag link|block|pathfinding/damage_cautious}} - blocks that will damage entities that walk through them, but are not considered dangerous enough to avoid entirely.
*** {{Tag link|block|pathfinding/damaging}} - blocks that will damage entities that walk through them.
*** {{Tag link|block|pathfinding/drop_down}} - blocks that can be dropped down through.
*** {{Tag link|block|pathfinding/leaves}} - blocks that are considered leaves.
*** {{Tag link|block|pathfinding/open}} - blocks that are considered completely open to walk through.
*** {{Tag link|block|pathfinding/powder_snow}} - blocks that are considered powder snow.
*** {{Tag link|block|pathfinding/rails}} - blocks that are considered rails.
*** {{Tag link|block|pathfinding/sticky}} - blocks that are considered sticky, causing slowed movement and inability to jump.

