== Changes ==
=== Blocks ===
'''[[Blue Ice|Blue]] and [[Packed Ice]]''' 
* Each variant now has unique sounds.

'''[[Brown mushroom]] and [[red mushroom]]'''
* Can now be placed on any block with a top solid face regardless of lighting conditions.
** They still cannot spread unless the brightness at the new growth is less than 13, or its support block overrides light requirements, like [[mycelium]].

'''[[Frosted ice]]''' 
* Now emits a vibration event when changing state.
* No longer show their inside block faces when placed next to each other.
* Now has unique sounds.

'''[[Ice]]''' 
* No longer shows its inside block faces when placed next to each other.
* Now has unique sounds.
* Added ambient sounds for regular ice block.
** When an ice block is surrounded by at least 8 ice blocks in all horizontal directions (east, west, north, and south), with one air block above and one water block below, it has a chance to emit a sound.

'''[[File:Jukebox JE3.png|32px]] [[Jukebox]]'''
* Textures changed from [[File:Jukebox JE2 BE2.png|32px]] to [[File:Jukebox JE3.png|32px]].
* Will now cycle through music discs in a single [[chest]], [[trapped chest]], or any [[copper chest]] variant placed directly above it.
** Discs play in slot order, skipping empty slots and other non-music-disc items and looping back to the start.
** When a disc finishes, the jukebox swaps it with the next disc in the chest.
** If the chest has no music discs, the jukebox will loop its inserted disc.
** Ejecting the current disc skips to the next available disc.

'''[[Pointed dripstone]]'''
* Now drips lava into cauldrons three times as often.

'''[[Snow]]'''
* Can now be placed on [[packed ice]].

=== Items ===
'''General'''
* Interacting with entities using an item will now correctly apply the item's use cooldown.

'''[[Carrot on a stick]] and [[warped fungus on a stick]]'''
* Now only boost for 7 to 35 instead of 7 to 49 seconds.

'''[[Snowball]]'''
* Now applies knockback to players.

'''[[Splash water bottle]] and [[lingering water bottle]]
* They no longer leave a [[glass bottle]] when used to convert blocks into mud.

=== Mobs === 
'''General'''
* Mobs can now break [[decorated pot]]s, [[chorus flower]]s and [[speleothem]] blocks with projectiles in an adventure mode world, unless the {{cd|mob_griefing}} gamerule is set to {{cd|false}}.
* Mobs falling through lava may take slightly less fall damage in some cases.

'''[[Ender dragon]]'''
* The ender dragon no longer has slower vertical velocity than intended, fixing several issues with its AI that were introduced in [[19w08b]] and restoring previously broken behavior:
** The dragon now properly reaches its flying and attacking points, no longer getting stuck flying back and forth between two points.
** The dragon now properly dives at the player periodically, when it shoots a fireball, and after it has finished perching.
** The dragon now properly descends to the portal, rather than flying back and forth while slowly descending.
*** [[Dragon fireball]]s also no longer collide with the ender dragon itself, allowing all dragon fireballs to properly reach their target.

'''[[Parrot]]s'''
* Can now imitate [[frostbite]]s.

'''[[Stray]]'''
* Strays can now spawn in the following biomes, matching {{BE}}:
** {{BiomeLink|Deep Frozen Ocean}}
** {{BiomeLink|Frozen Ocean}}
** {{BiomeLink|Frozen Peaks}}
** {{BiomeLink|Frozen River}}
** {{BiomeLink|Jagged Peaks}}
** {{BiomeLink|Snowy Slopes}}

'''[[Sulfur cube]]'''
* Added the "Cold" archetype, with similar properties to "Fast Sliding".
** Used when the sulfur cube absorbs a [[blue ice]] block.
** Floats and replaces water below it with a disk of [[frosted ice]] when it moves, similar to the [[Frost Walker]] enchantment.
*** Will only place frosted ice if the sulfur cube starts its movement while it is on ground.
*** Air blocks above the water block are required for frosted ice placement.
* Small sulfur cubes that spawn from splitting a bucketed sulfur cube now inherit the property of not despawning.

'''[[Undead|Undead mobs]]'''
* [[Drowned]] and [[husk]]s now [[Mob conversion|convert]] into [[zombie]]s when in [[powder snow]].
** They will not convert if they are wearing a piece of [[leather armor]].
* [[Skeleton]]s no longer convert into [[stray]]s when in powder snow if they are wearing a piece of leather armor.

'''[[Wandering trader]]'''
* Can now sell [[ice crystal]]s and [[icicle]]s.<!-- In what amounts? eg how much emeralds and how much of the items do you get -->

'''[[Zombie]]'''
* Now converts into a [[frostbite]] when it is in powder snow.
** Zombies wearing any piece of leather armor will prevent them from converting into frostbites.
* Is now immune to freezing in powder snow and will not take damage from the Freezing effect.

