'''[[Structure pool element]]s'''
* Added optional {{cd|corner_constraint}} field
** Limits the placement of a structure pool element this by sampling a density function at the corners of its bounding box.
** Format: list of objects with fields:
*** {{cd|density_function}} — the density function to sample at the bounding box' corner.
*** {{cd|acceptable_density}} — inclusive range of doubles, a corner's sampled density within this range counts as "inside".
*** {{cd|padding}} — integer between {{cd|0}}, and {{cd|8}}, the padding of the bounding box before sampling its corners.
**** If not present, defaults to {{cd|0}}.
*** {{cd|corners}} — one of {{cd|all}}, {{cd|top}}, or {{cd|bottom}}, which corners to check.
**** If not present, defaults to {{cd|all}}.
*** {{cd|required_corners}} — range between {{cd|1}}, and {{cd|8}}, the number of corners that must be inside {{cd|acceptable_density}} for the check to pass.

